Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; 19 - Programs that start with Windows begin at once.
; Windows waits about ten seconds after sign-in before it starts your startup programs.
; This removes the wait. The desktop appears the same; the programs are ready sooner.
; It does not make the PC start faster and does not change which programs start.
; Takes effect at the next sign-in. Undo: menu 7, then 19.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Serialize]
"StartupDelayInMSec"=dword:00000000
